# OPTIONAL API keys. The planner works without any of them.
# Copy this file to .env (git ignores it) only if you want to paste a key yourself; otherwise Claude adds it for you with
#   python3 -I scripts/setup.py add-key <service>   (the key is read from stdin, saved in .env with mode 600)
# After pasting a key in .env yourself, ask Claude to register it: it runs add-key reading the key from .env, never showing it.
# Each key also registers its server in your private Claude Code config (never in the repository).
# What each service gives you, its free tier and where to sign up: python3 scripts/setup.py services

SERPAPI_API_KEY=
APIFY_TOKEN=
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
BRAVE_API_KEY=
EXA_API_KEY=
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=
